            <h4 style="color: #002147; border-bottom: 2px solid #004080; padding-bottom: 5px; font-size:20px; font-weight:600;">ABOUT Sandeep Kumar Vishwakarma</h4>
            <p style="font-size:16px; font-family:Arial; line-height:30px; text-align:justify; color:black;">
                Sandeep Kumar Vishwakarma is working as an Assistant Professor in the Department of Mechanical Engineering at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh. Currently, he is serving as the Head of the department of Mechanical Engineering Deapartment and Officer Incharge of Training and Placement at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh. His research interest includes, Acoustical Engineering, Finite Element modelling of mufflers, design and fabrication of reactive mufflers. He is pursuing his Ph.D. from Motilal Nehru National Institute of Technology Allahabad, Prayagraj. Before joining at Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh, he has worked as Assistant Professor in the Department of Mechanical Engineering at Institute of Engineering and Technology, Lucknow for one year. He has completed his M. Tech from Motilal Nehru National Institute of Technology Allahabad, Prayagraj. He has published several research papers in reputed International/national journals and conferences. He is also a recipient of Best Paper Award in 2023, presented by acoustical society.
            </p>

